// the Trainers' personalities (the owner's ask: 200 in the first 16 families, then 16 more families), each inside one of the 32 families (ARCHS in a6e_people.js, which picks one per Trainer):
//   n the name shown on their profile · a the family · op favourite Pokémon / ty favourite types (their favourites come from these) · v the voice
//   their corpus lines lean to (on top of the family's) · ps the playstyle they run when they run a competitive team (ARCHETYPES ids in a6g_teams.js) · t nudges to their traits · top the chat topics they bring up more (×) · sch [hour, hours]
//   when they play · st typing quirks · say their own Union Room lines ("lead:" only from a Club Leader, "club:" from a Club member, "noclub:" from
//   someone in none) · hi a greeting · mood "how are you?" · fight a friendly battle's opening line · bio an About me (a share of them use it)
